        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Starting going to the Walmart when it 1st opened, about 20 years ago. Sadly after it reopened aftet the fire, its crappy :-( Im very sad. Hopefuly one day it'll find it footing again and be a great walmart again.",
