        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Had lots of stores and products that I wanted to buy. Service was good. Only problem is you have to walk outside to get from store to store so, it's not convenient depending on the weather. Also not all stores have bathrooms for the customers. Not cool when you're spending how much $ and have kids who need to pee.",
